{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep5/quest_story/15246500.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15246500","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15246500","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1524650001:0":{"text":"아, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>! 갈라가 부른 마법사가 너였구나?","source_cn":"啊，<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA291829D6067A060","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>! 갈라가 부른 마법사가 너였구나?","female":"아, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>! 갈라가 부른 마법사가 너였구나?","variant_male_record_index":"194602","variant_female_record_index":"194603","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1524650002:1":{"text":"네 실력은 익히 들었어. 네가 도와준다면 이번 사냥은 문제없겠군.","source_cn":"你的实力我们早有耳闻，有你帮忙，这次围猎的结果肯定不错。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF033261FAF89966F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네 실력은 익히 들었어. 네가 도와준다면 이번 사냥은 문제없겠군.","female":"네 실력은 익히 들었어. 네가 도와준다면 이번 사냥은 문제없겠군.","variant_male_record_index":"194604","variant_female_record_index":"194605","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1524650003:1":{"text":"사냥대가 다 모여있어. 지금은 짐승을 유인할 미끼에 대해 이야기하는 중이야.","source_cn":"狩猎队的队员都已经到齐了，我们现在正在讨论用什么诱饵把...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x839A6267BBA00CEA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"사냥대가 다 모여있어. 지금은 짐승을 유인할 미끼에 대해 이야기하는 중이야.","female":"사냥대가 다 모여있어. 지금은 짐승을 유인할 미끼에 대해 이야기하는 중이야.","variant_male_record_index":"194606","variant_female_record_index":"194607","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1524650004:1":{"text":"평소에 쓰는 미끼를 더 많이 두면 어떨까?","source_cn":"就用平时的诱饵，多放几个怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC82BD29E751BC406","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1524650005:1":{"text":"몇 번이나 추적했지만 흔적 하나 남기지 않는 교활한 놈이야. 평범한 미끼로는 쉽지 않겠어.","source_cn":"这野兽狡猾得很，那么多次都没暴露过踪迹，普通的诱饵恐怕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x772DFD84C24F51ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1524650006:1":{"text":"강가 근처에서 놈의 흔적을 발견했잖아? 커다란 물고기를 미끼로 쓰는 건 어떨까?","source_cn":"我们是在河流边发现它活动痕迹的，说不定用大块鱼肉能行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CF647BA562B80CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1524650007:1":{"text":"그렇다면 <style=\"highlight\">큰 물고기 몇 마리를 낚아서</style> 미끼로 쓰자.","source_cn":"既然这样，我们就先去<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x102F33C5548D66F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:战士巨力":{"text":"전사 스트롱파워","source":"战士巨力","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:战士莽":{"text":"전사 래쉬","source":"战士莽","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:战士裂尾":{"text":"전사 스플릿테일","source":"战士裂尾","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep5/quest_story/15246520.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15246520","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15246520","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"n